  "docs": "SPEC §11 launch suite 2 — real tool schemas from three PUBLIC MCP servers actually configured on this machine (context7, github, playwright/agent-browser), vendored with attribution (repo+commit+blobSha, byte-verified by CI re-fetch). Includes genuinely confusable pairs: resolve-library-id vs query-docs (both take a free-text 'query'), search_issues vs search_code vs list_issues (search-vs-structured-list, issues-vs-code), browser_snapshot vs browser_take_screenshot (the upstream README explicitly warns about this exact confusion). 20 positive + 8 negative. Nothing from any private employer- or client-specific world appears here — every artifact is public and byte-verified against a commit.",
  "formatVersion": 1,
